    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Pat Callanan Property Sales Ltd are delighted to present to the market this residential property for sale by private treaty at Ballagh, Menlough, Ballinasloe, Co. Galway.\n\nKnown locally as \"The Thatch\", this charming traditional cottage offers exceptional restoration and development potential for those seeking to revive a unique piece of Ireland's rural heritage. Retaining much of its original character and old-world appeal, the property presents an excellent opportunity to restore and enhance a traditional thatched residence while preserving its distinctive charm.\n\nThe accommodation comprises four rooms, including a living room with solid fuel stove and two bedrooms. The property benefits from PVC windows and a rear extension with a galvanised sheet roof. There are also a number of outbuildings and sheds located on the 0.5acre site.\n\nTraditional thatched properties may be eligible for conservation and maintenance grant assistance through heritage and local authority schemes, subject to qualifying criteria, offering prospective purchasers potential support in preserving and maintaining this unique heritage asset.\n\nThis property will appeal to those seeking a restoration project, a countryside retreat, or an opportunity to safeguard and enhance a traditional Irish cottage for future generations.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Pat Callanan Property Sales Ltd on 091 844818."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Charming cottage residence\n* Old style thatch roof\n* Development potential with a little imagination\n* Loose storage sheds suitable for a number of purposes\n\n"
      },
      {
